                                    </padding>
                                 </Separator>
                                 <TextFlow prefHeight="200.0" prefWidth="200.0">
                                    <children>
                                       <Text strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="TalentLink is a " />
                                       <Text layoutX="10.0" layoutY="10.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" styleClass="bold" text="desktop application that HR recruiters in recruitment agencies use to manage their contacts, optimized for use through a Command Line Interface (CLI)" />
                                       <Text layoutX="10.0" layoutY="10.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text=" while retaining the benefits of a Graphical User Interface (GUI). If you type quickly, TalentLink can help you manage your jobseeker/client contacts faster than traditional GUI applications. Additionally, TalentLink also provides support for many tasks that recruiters often do on a daily basis, such as recording notes on various jobseekers/clients, searching for jobseekers with particular educational qualifications and determine which jobseekers to link up with each client’s job opening." />
                                    </children>
                                    <VBox.margin>
                                       <Insets bottom="15.0" />
                                    </VBox.margin>
                                 </TextFlow>
